# This project has no local .env consumer -- no script here reads a PAT
# from the environment. This file exists purely as documentation of what
# credential the pipeline depends on and where it actually lives, since
# that dependency isn't visible anywhere else in the repo.
#
# The real GitHub fine-grained PAT (Contents: Read and write, scoped to
# this one repo) is typed directly into the iOS Shortcut's Authorization
# header, on-device. It is never stored in this repo, in any file, or
# committed anywhere.
#
# If it's ever exposed, revoke it immediately at:
# https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta

GITHUB_PAT=your_fine_grained_pat_here
